'''Cat God the Great''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] added in [[Version 7.2 Update|Version 7.2]] that is unlocked by completing [[Cats of the Cosmos]], Chapter 2. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 10.0 Update|Version 10.0]] grants the [[Money Up]] ability with marginally improved health. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 14.7 Update|Version 14.7]].

