==Trivia==
*His pose is taken from Michelangelo's ''[[wikipedia:David (Michelangelo)|David]]'' sculpture.
*His first two and final hits recycle animations from the "God Bless You" and "Wrath of God" miracles respectively.
*He has the fourth-highest maximum range of all [[:Category:Omni Strike Cats|Omni Strike Cats]], only beaten by [[The 10th Angel (Uber Rare Cat)|The 10th Angel]], [[The Grateful Crane (Uber Rare Cat)|Supernova Cosmo]], and [[Master of Logic Newtone (Special Cat)|Master of Logic Newtone]].
**He also has the third farthest negative range, being surpassed by [[Betrothed Balaluga (Uber Rare Cat)|Betrothed Pasalan]] for second place and [[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Elder Mask Doron]] for first.
*His Catfruit Evolution description is the only one to give no information about improvements in their true form, instead teaching the player one of the ways to obtain Gold Catfruit, in this case from the [[Cat Shrine]].

